    <briefdescription>
<para>Hughes–Winget objective integration algorithm. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Given the deformation gradients at the beginning and end of an increment, this class computes:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>the symmetric strain increment in Voigt notation,</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>the incremental rotation matrix,</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>a rotated stress tensor, and</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>consistent tangent contributions for mixed deformation-gradient/stress quantities. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
